# Prettier is configured with `endOfLine: lf`, so that has to mean the same
# thing on every machine. Git stores text as LF and checks it out as LF here,
# regardless of a contributor's local `core.autocrlf`, which on Windows would
# otherwise hand Prettier CRLF files and fail `format:check` for the whole
# repository while continuous integration on Linux reported it clean.
* text=auto eol=lf
